01:09:00,000 --> 01:09:06,000
King Lear is a 2018 British-American television film directed by Richard Eyre.

10
01:16:40,000 --> 01:16:46,000
An adaptation of the play of the same name by William Shakespeare, cut to
just 115 minutes, it was broadcast on BBC Two on 28 May 2018.

11
01:24:20,000 --> 01:24:26,000
Starring Anthony Hopkins as the title character, the abridged adaptation is set in a highly militarised version of 21st-century London and depicts the
tragedy that follows when the sovereign King Lear announces the end of his reign and the division of his kingdom among his three daughters.

12
01:32:00,000 --> 01:32:06,000
The adaptation was met with positive reviews, which commended its acting, and
many singled out Hopkins for his performance in the title role.

13
01:39:40,000 --> 01:39:46,000
The film explores themes of theater play, fool, tragedy, storm, king lear.

14
01:47:20,000 --> 01:47:26,000
The tone is emotional.
